OL,3,GNEWSAConsultation starts into plans to
OL,4,Aclose sixth form
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to close the sixth form at
OL,7,FWaltham Toll Bar Academy in North East
OL,8,FLincolnshire have been put out to
OL,9,Fpublic consultation.
OL,11,FThe school said it had been forced into
OL,12,Fthe decision due to falling numbers of
OL,13,Fstudents, with only 50 starting Year 12
OL,14,Fin September.
OL,16,FIf the proposal is approved, the sixth
OL,17,Fform will stay open until July 2028 for
OL,18,Fcurrent Year 12 students but there will
OL,19,Fbe no new intake in September 2027.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
