OL,3,GNEWSAConsultation starts into plans to
OL,4,Aclose sixth form
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrincipal Joe Hermiston said: "It's
OL,7,Fwith a heavy heart that we're at this
OL,8,Fpoint, but we have to think about the
OL,9,Flong-term viability of the rest of the
OL,10,Fschool and make sure that we're making
OL,11,Fdecisions that secure the future for
OL,12,Fall students... not just sixth form
OL,13,Fstudents."
